; Original pressure-reducing-valve civil hydraulic verification case.
; SI input: LPS flows, metres elevations/lengths/PRV setting, millimetres diameter.
; Reference results are generated independently by WNTR 1.5.0 / EPANET 2.2.
[TITLE]
Active PRV limits downstream pressure head to 20 m

[JUNCTIONS]
;ID Elevation Demand
A 0 0
B 0 5

[RESERVOIRS]
;ID Head
R 60

[PIPES]
;ID Node1 Node2 Length Diameter Roughness MinorLoss Status
RA R A 100 200 130 0 OPEN

[VALVES]
;ID Node1 Node2 Diameter Type Setting MinorLoss
V A B 200 PRV 20 0

[OPTIONS]
UNITS LPS
HEADLOSS H-W
DEMAND MODEL DDA
SPECIFIC GRAVITY 1
VISCOSITY 1
TRIALS 200
ACCURACY 0.000001
UNBALANCED STOP
DEMAND MULTIPLIER 1

[TIMES]
DURATION 0
HYDRAULIC TIMESTEP 1:00
PATTERN TIMESTEP 1:00
REPORT TIMESTEP 1:00
REPORT START 0:00

[REPORT]
STATUS YES
SUMMARY YES
NODES ALL
LINKS ALL

[COORDINATES]
R 0 0
A 100 0
B 200 0

[END]
